# Data — regenerate with scripts/build_aa_dataset.py and build_event_dataset.py.
# The AA birth corpus and the derived event file are reproducible from public
# sources, so they are not committed; that keeps a 3.6MB generated blob out of
# history and forces the acquisition step to be explicit.
data/*.csv
data/app.db
data/*.db

